<title>USA: CCF Holding sets stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>CCF Holding sets stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>JONESBORO, Ga. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CCF Holding Company on Tuesday said it will repurchase up to 91,590 shares, or about 10 percent, of its common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>CCF, the holding copmany of Clayton County Federal Savings and Loan Association, said its board has approved the buyback, and now awaits regulatory authorization.</p>
<p>CCF has 915,900 outstanding shares of common stock.</p>
<p>This repurchase program follows the previous repurchase of 214,800 shares thus far this year, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
